    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [x] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.files\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.12 (!at least latest Nightly build!)\n\n### Description\n\nI'm pretty confident this is not strictly related to files module, but on the latest nightly there are some visual glitches, e.g. additional line at the bottom as shown here\n\n<img width=\"556\" height=\"484\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e0f01ddd-531a-4181-9c71-364a43ae0d7d\" />\n\n### Reproduction\n\nUse latest nightly",
